   <tbody>
    <tr>
     <td><para unique="1091405">F6 /2</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091407">NOT r/m8<footnote><para unique="1092186" format="TableFootnote"><anchor id="70102: TableFootnote: 1. With a REX prefix in 64-bit mode, attempts to acce"/>With a REX prefix in 64-bit mode, attempts to access AH, BH, CH, or DH will instead access SPL, DIL, BPL, or SIL, respectively. </para>
        </footnote></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091409">M</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091411">Valid</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091413">Valid</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091415">Reverse each bit of r/m8.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
